ETHICS_POLICY_EN = """CODE OF PROFESSIONAL ETHICS AND INTERNAL ANTI-CORRUPTION POLICY OF THE CENTER

SECTION 1. GENERAL PROVISIONS
1. This Code is established in compliance with the Law of the Republic of Uzbekistan 'On Combating Corruption' and 'On Conflict of Interest'.
2. The Center enforces a strict Zero Tolerance policy towards all forms of corruption, bribery, nepotism, and unethical conduct.
3. The Code is binding for all faculty, administration, and staff of the Center.

SECTION 2. CORE PRINCIPLES
— Rule of law and professional integrity;
— Objective, merit-based assessment of all course participants without bias;
— Absolute ban on gifts, gratuities, or personal favors from students or third parties;
— Prompt disclosure and resolution of potential conflicts of interest.

SECTION 3. ENFORCEMENT & DISCIPLINARY ACTIONS
Violations will result in severe disciplinary action including immediate termination and referral to law enforcement authorities."""

